Playerbots.ArenaPlanTeams / ArenaPlanFile: one line per matchup, keyed by both teams' sorted class ids, gives
the kill-target class. While that enemy can be hit (alive, seen, in LoS within 40 yd, not immune, not in a
teammate's breakable CC) it is the enemy player and dps target of the team's damage dealers; otherwise the rules
pick as before. Re-read every 10 s.

